The '''Goblin Holdout''' is a randomly-generated area in the {{Zone|Crystal Hollows}}.

{{ZoneText|Home of Goblins.|Rich with Amber Gemstones.}}

== Purpose ==
{{MobSprite|Goblin}}s spawn here similarly to the {{Zone|Goblin Burrows}} (except that higher level variants can spawn around important {{Zone|Crystal Hollows}} [[Crystal Hollows/Special Locations|structures]], those being: "'''{{NPCSprite|King Yolkar}}'s Tower'''" and the so called "[[Crystal Hollows/Special Locations|'''Deep Goblin Lair''']]").

In the sublocation {{Zone|Goblin Queen's Den}}, player can obtain the {{Item|Amber Crystal}}.

{{Item|Nether Quartz Ore}} and {{Item|Netherrack}} spawns very rarely, but if they are mined they drop nothing except some {{Item|Experience Orbs}} in the case of the former.

